 <title>Custom search forms with Apache Solr</title>
 <link>http://2011.drupalcamp.es/en/sessions/custom-search-forms-apache-solr</link>
 <description>&lt;p&gt;In this session we will work with Apache Solr from the code of a custom module. We will start installing Apache Solr and the &lt;a href=&quot;http://drupal.org/project/apachesolr&quot;&gt;apachesolr module&lt;/a&gt;. Then we will create a custom module with a search form with fields to filter, adding new fields to the Apache Solr schema, working a bit with the Solr query syntax and we will learn how to use some of the hooks and functions of the Apache Solr API.&lt;/p&gt;
